  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "fmsdisk 5.01 and its FFx Mountlist entries",
    "AmigaOS IconX, Mount and Format for MountFMS",
    "reqtools.library v38 or later for ADF2FMS requesters",
    "MultiView and the AmigaGuide datatype for the guides"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The version is the shipped ADF2FMS release. Both guides come from the fmsdisk 5.01 archive.",
    "The checked BCWB payload supplies the Bloodwych MountFMS script, the Unit0 backing image and the Workbench icons.",
    "MountFMS assigns FMS: to SYS:Programs/FMSsys, mounts FF0: with DEVS:Mountlist and offers the native Format confirmation. ADF2FMS writes through fmsdisk.device.",
    "The separate fmsdisk entry owns DEVS:fmsdisk.device and DEVS:Mountlist. The shared reqtools.library remains a separate dependency."
  ],
